Recipes
=======

Short answers to common lab tasks. Full labs live in https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/tree/main/examples.

* Campus switching: VLANs, trunks, EtherChannel, STP root, security
  https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/docs/recipes/campus-switching
* Routing labs: multi site OSPF, EIGRP, static backup
  https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/docs/recipes/routing-labs
* Edge router: NAT, ACL, SSH, DHCP
  https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/docs/recipes/edge-router
* Servers: one call per service
  https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/docs/recipes/servers
* Documenting a topology: zones, labels, IP notes
  https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/docs/recipes/documenting
